msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"Did you see that dump truck smash into the Diet building? I saw it on the "
"news! It was crazy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"Yeah, they said it might've been some kind of protest about the military "
"expansion bill, but it was basically a terrorist attack, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid "I don't think violence is ever the answer, no matter what the cause."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "Passing bills is the Diet's business, right? What's it got to do with us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid ""
"What do you mean? We elected them. They're supposed to be representing our "
"interests."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"If you don't like how the current Diet handles things, you should get your "
"opinion across by voting in the next election."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Yeah, but that's not for a while, right? Seems like the only way to get "
"your opinion across right away is by doing something crazy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I don't know... It all seems so complicated. Though I do feel like I should "
"watch the news more often!"
msgstr ""

